{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Messages｜结构图\n箭头表示接口调用、事件载荷或逻辑委托；HealthSet 持有数值/边沿，GAS 持有聚合器，Router 按通道同步通知。\n[[Messages/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Messages.canvas|发布流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1530,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOHealthSet\nPre/PostGameplayEffectExecute → meta消费。\nTrySetCurrentValue → Current提交/确认。\nPostAttributeChange → 边界/Changed/归零。\nPre/PostNetReceive → 弱源同Base投影。\nPublishMessageResult → 投递结果。\n[[Messages/结构#HealthSet 的复制调用作用域|复制作用域]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "payload",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOVerbMessage\nVerb → 通道；Instigator → 真实EffectCauser（可空）；Target → ASC宿主。\nTags → 原Modifier捕获快照。\nMagnitude → Damage/meta原幅度；直接Poise破韧为该次实际损失。\n载荷为原事件事实，实时ASC可已有后续变化。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "router",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGameplayMessageSubsystem\nBroadcastMessage(Verb,Message) → 同步派发。\nHealthSet校验依赖/真实销毁。\n结果Delivered/Retired/DependencyFailure。\n路由不存GAS状态、不提供网络传输。",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "readers",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 消息消费者（订阅接口）\nRegisterListener(Verb, Callback) → 自有订阅句柄。\n消费者只读消息；跨回调复制所需数据并处理对象失效。\n生命周期结束时Handle.Unregister。",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "event",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## HealthComponent / 指定ASC能力事件\nHealthSet的OnOutOfHealth/OnPoiseBroken → HealthComponent归零逻辑委托。\nHandleGameplayEvent(EventTag, Payload) → 指定ASC能力链。\n只读GameplayMessage不请求GA。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 状态与调用局部事实\nHealth/Poise有限Base允许越界，Current保持0..Max及所属MinimumHealth；Buff移除沿既有归零逻辑，无额外复活/补偿。\nModifier/Expected-write标记保存来源与真实Post事实，meta清理回调后重新换算；提交失败撤原帧Damage候选。\nRepNotify帧仅存本宏阶段/弱来源/一次有效值；NetReceive帧仅存原接收请求，不拥有聚合器/dirty执行。\nRouter真实销毁退休；依赖缺失明确诊断，恢复只发新事件。[[Messages/结构#Router 生命周期与发布|发布契约]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "asc-current-calculation",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAbilitySystemComponent\nTryCalculateNumericAttributeBaseForCurrentValue\n输入原Set、Attribute、ExpectedCurrent、DesiredCurrent。\n输出Ready/Rejected/Stale＋Reason；仅Ready/None提供有限CalculatedBase。\n原生资格、唯一逆解与正向回验；计算本身不写属性。\nSetNumericAttributeBase → 原生聚合/属性回调。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|ASC接口归属]]",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 350,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "source",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "payload",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "QueueMessageResult保存原事件载荷"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "payload",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "router",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "依赖有效→BroadcastMessage"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "router",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "readers",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "同步调用已注册的只读回调"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "source",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "event",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "属性/归零逻辑委托"
    },
    {
      "id": "s-current-calculate",
      "fromNode": "source",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "asc-current-calculation",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "调用薄换算/原GAS setter；HealthSet确认OwnPost"
    }
  ]
}
